Every panel query in demo/grafana/dashboards/maestro.json executed THROUGH
Grafana (POST /api/ds/query against datasource uid maestro-prometheus),
not against Prometheus directly -- so this proves datasource provisioning,
the uid pinning and the query all work, which is what 'the dashboard
renders non-empty' actually means.

