panel 5 [DATA] http=200 frames=1 points=181  Stand-downs by reason (B)
           expr: vector(0)

NOTE on panel 5: maestro_standdown_total does not exist yet on a quiet
single-node stack -- MicrometerEngineObserver registers that counter
lazily on the first stand-down. Query A therefore returns zero series.
The panel's companion vector(0) series (B, 181 points) is why it renders
a flat zero instead of 'No data'.
